    "notes": "Derived from codes/211-12-12.json, not an independent construction; that entry is my own earlier reduction, and this one goes further with a larger move set. The gate reports no exact duplicate and no WL-equivalent entry. It dominates [[211,12,12]], [[240,12,12]], [[242,12,12]] on (n, k, d, w), which therefore leave the frontier of every cell they share with it. The measured interaction radius is unchanged at 6.7082, so the reduced code is no less local than the source. Distance is a witness-backed upper bound: the deepest null result is 20000000 fresh-seed RIS trials. Literature novelty is unverified.",
